# =============================================================================
# 行尾与文本属性
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 仓库内统一存 LF（git 的 text 规范化），检出也保持 LF，避免 core.autocrlf=true
# 带来的 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 噪音，以及跨平台 diff 抖动。
#
# 匹配优先级：同名文件命中多条规则时，**文件里最后一条生效**。
# 因此 LFS 的 -text 规则必须放在文件末尾，否则会被 * text=auto 覆盖。
# =============================================================================
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须按 CRLF 检出：cmd 对 LF-only 的 goto / 标签 / 多行结构
# 解析不可靠。注意仓库内仍存 LF，只有工作区是 CRLF。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 明确按二进制处理，禁止任何行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.wasm binary
*.zip  binary
*.7z   binary
*.gz   binary

# =============================================================================
# Git LFS（必须保持在文件最后）
# =============================================================================
iEXA-WIN.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
release/IEXA-Setup.exe filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
